[I] Vpnc-script replacement for easy and secure split-tunnel VPN setup

[T] vpn-slice is a Python replacement for the vpnc-script used by
[T] OpenConnect and vpnc. It makes split-tunnel setups easy by routing only
[T] the specified hosts and subnets through the VPN and adding their names
[T] to /etc/hosts, without changing the default route or DNS configuration.

[U] https://github.com/dlenski/vpn-slice

